  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, the graph of \\(ax + 3y = 12\\), where \\(a\\) is a constant, passes through the point \\((2, 6)\\). What is the value of \\(a\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "-3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Substitute \\(x = 2\\) and \\(y = 6\\): \\(2a + 18 = 12\\).",
    "Subtract 18: \\(2a = -6\\), so \\(a = -3\\)."
  ],
